    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always seen math as a tool rather than a passion. It’s practical, especially in everyday life—like budgeting or understanding patterns in nature. I enjoy the logic, but I don’t feel deeply connected to it like I do with philosophy or history. It’s something I use, not something I explore with curiosity.",
