    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used an AI tutor app last year to review algebra and calculus. It explained steps clearly and adapted to my pace. It helped me understand concepts I struggled with, like integration. The only downside was that it didn’t always show the 'why' behind formulas—more like a shortcut.",
